，相比第一代约20升增加了约55%。对于喜欢水景造景的人来说，多出的空间意味着可以放置更大的装饰物，前后层次更清晰，而斑马鱼等群游鱼类也有更多游动空间。代价是换水需要更大的容器，装满水后鱼缸更重，因此家具必须能承受其重量。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 1037, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 90.675, "size_bytes": 545040, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 284, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 92.2, "size_bytes": 554112, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 284, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/107/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 98.175, "size_bytes": 589968, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 284, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/107/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 85.725, "size_bytes": 515376, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 284, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/107/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 92.3, "size_bytes": 554688, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 284, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/107/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@bbc199a8/content/data/versions/1054.json"}], "en_c1": [{"content_hash": "af5524982c413f72", "version_id": 1055, "article_id": 107, "level_code": "en_c1", "lang": "en", "level": 5, "level_label": "C1 高级", "title": "Xiaomi's Mijia Smart Aquarium 2 Pro grows to 30L and adds spot lighting", "title_zh": "小米米家智能鱼缸2 Pro升级至30L并新增聚光灯", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "sspai", "source_url": "https://sspai.com/post/119023", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571008887538-b36bb32f4571?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8N3x8cHJvfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTU0OTc5NDZ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by sporlab on Unsplash", "author": "sporlab", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@sporlab?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/pair-of-blue-and-white-adidas-running-shoes-XiZ7pRvCzro?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(206, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(244, 46%, 48%)", "label": "LIFESTYLE", "seed": "4886abeeaa35"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-24", "word_count": 281, "reading_minutes": 1.4, "lead": "Xiaomi has launched the Mijia Smart Aquarium 2 Pro, the third tank in a series built around all-in-one design and app-based control. With a 55% jump in water volume, a redesigned top filter and a new spotlight, it aims to make fishkeeping easier for beginners.", "lead_zh": "小米推出了米家智能鱼缸2 Pro，这是该系列中第三款以一体式设计和App控制为核心的鱼缸。水量提升55%，顶部过滤器重新设计，并新增聚光灯，旨在让新手养鱼更轻松。", "preview": "The most tangible change is size. The original tank measured 446 × 246 × 295mm and held roughly 20L; the 2 Pro expands to 505 × 292 × 334mm ", "preview_zh": "最直观的变化是尺寸。初代鱼缸为446 × 246 × 295毫米，容量约20升；2 Pro扩大到505 × 292 × 334毫米，约30升。多出的10升为造景爱好者提供了更大空间来分层布置水草和硬景观，斑马鱼等群游鱼种也能游得更自在。代价是重量和维护：换水量更大，需要更大的容器", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 1038, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_c1.mp3", "duration": 113.475, "size_bytes": 681840, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 322, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_c1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 116.375, "size_bytes": 699264, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 322, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/107/en_c1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_c1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 123.95, "size_bytes": 744624, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 322, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/107/en_c1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_c1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 107.875, "size_bytes": 648144, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 322, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/107/en_c1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_c1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 115.65, "size_bytes": 694800, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 322, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/107/en_c1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@bbc199a8/content/data/versions/1055.json"}]}, "ja": {"ja_n5": [{"content_hash": "0e2c006b11e649cb", "version_id": 1056, "article_id": 107, "level_code": "ja_n5", "lang": "ja", "level": 1, "level_label": "N5 初級", "title": "Xiaomi、新しい水そう「Mijiaスマート水そう2 Pro」を発売", "title_zh": "小米发布新款鱼缸“米家智能鱼缸2 Pro”", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "sspai", "source_url": "https://sspai.com/post/119023", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571008887538-b36bb32f4571?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8N3x8cHJvfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTU0OTc5NDZ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by sporlab on Unsplash", "author": "sporlab", "credit_url": "https://unsplas